 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 5 - 6, use the following.</p>\n\n<p>The functions below model the height of a projectile in feet, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span> seconds after launch.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><span data-math=\"h(t) = -7t^2 + 34t + 48\">h(t) = -7t^2 + 34t + 48</span></li>\n    <li><span data-math=\"h(t) = (-7t − 8)(t − 6)\">h(t) = (-7t − 8)(t − 6)</span></li>\n  </ul>\n",
